  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Sustained spikes in oil prices increase energy, transport and construction costs and can force delays or downscaling of capital‑intensive fab buildouts, slowing the expansion of advanced‑node production capacity.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_conflict</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
