  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in the geopolitical financial risk premium causes rapid repricing across fixed‑income markets (widening spreads, forced de‑leveraging and larger bid/ask moves), which directly increases realized and implied bond-market volatility.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
