  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher geopolitical risk premia increase financing and insurance costs for arms purchases and long-distance logistics, prompting buyers and suppliers to defer or scale back deliveries of weapons and ammunition to Ukraine.</data>
