  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">An elevated risk premium tied to the regional conflict raises the cost of debt and required returns, directly reducing the willingness of firms and sponsors to commit the large, long‑dated capital needed for new tech and fab projects.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_regional_conflict</data>
