  <data key="d37">Sustained high battlefield intensity raises urgency about defense‑relevant supply vulnerabilities, prompting accelerated government subsidies and private capital commitments to domestic/ally chip fabs and tooling to insulate the U.S. tech base from rivals like China.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
