  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp rises in combat operations prompt immediate rounds of high-level visits, emergency briefings and public statements from allied capitals to show support, deter escalation and manage domestic politics.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">western_alliance_realign</data>
</edge>
