  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A measurable shift in the theatre-capability balance toward an adversary increases threat perceptions across allied governments, prompting calls for deeper institutional commitments (expanded basing, force pooling, accelerated membership or capability-sharing initiatives).</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
