  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising volumes and coordination of arms deliveries force synchronized export approvals, common end‑use conditions and joint training plans, driving closer convergence of allied policy positions on military aid and sanctions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">western_alliance_realign</data>
</edge>
