<edge source="us_china_tech_rivalry::capital_invest_flow" target="global_bond_rate_shock::long_term_yield" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained surge in capital investment into tech manufacturing increases demand for long-term debt financing (corporate and project bonds) and pressures supply of long-dated debt, putting upward pressure on long-term sovereign yields via higher term premia and competing funding needs.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_rate_shock</data>
