  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Increased capital investment into allied high‑tech manufacturing expands production of electronics, sensors and control components that are integrated into drones, guided munitions and communications gear, enabling higher‑volume weapons deliveries into the Ukraine theatre.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
