  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Improvements in allied supply‑chain resilience reduce crisis events and ad‑hoc requests for access or rerouting, lowering the frequency and intensity of emergency diplomatic communications and coordination.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
