  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">A pronounced drying up of sovereign and corporate bond liquidity in parts of the alliance raises calls for common backstops, coordinated market‑making or pooled financial instruments, producing political pressure to pursue closer institutional integration.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_bond_rate_shock</data>
  <data key="d40">western_alliance_realign</data>
</edge>
