  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">A global bond-rate-induced reallocation of capital toward higher sovereign yields draws down cross-border financing available for foreign direct investment and project finance, directly reducing the flow of funds into capital‑intensive tech manufacturing projects.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
