  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp shifts or reversals in cross‑border capital flows trigger rapid government-to-government outreach (official visits, public assurances, coordination requests for swap lines or capital controls), increasing the frequency and intensity of diplomatic signaling among allied states.</data>
