<edge source="western_alliance_realign::policy_alignment_level" target="global_bond_rate_shock::bond_market_volatility" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in policy_alignment_level among Western governments reduces geopolitical and policy uncertainty, prompting investors to cut risk premia and lowering short- to medium-term realised and implied bond-market volatility.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">western_alliance_realign</data>
  <data key="d40">global_bond_rate_shock</data>
</edge>
<edge source="western_alliance_realign::policy_alignment_level" target="iran_regional_conflict::conflict_intensity" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A higher level of allied policy alignment rapidly enables coordinated military authorization, intelligence-sharing and joint operations against Iranian forces and proxies, producing immediate upticks in kinetic engagements and reciprocal strikes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">western_alliance_realign</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_regional_conflict</data>
</edge>
<edge source="western_alliance_realign::policy_alignment_level" target="russia_ukraine_war::military_cap_balance" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Closer policy alignment enables coordinated intelligence sharing, common targeting priorities, and synchronized training/logistics support that directly improve Ukrainian operational effectiveness relative to Russian forces, shifting the military capability balance.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">western_alliance_realign</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="western_alliance_realign::policy_alignment_level" target="us_china_tech_rivalry::export_control_str" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher policy alignment among Western allies shortens the diplomatic and legal path to coordinated sanctions and harmonised export-control lists, producing faster and broader tightening of technology transfer restrictions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">western_alliance_realign</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
