  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">High-frequency, high-intensity diplomatic signaling (public warnings, red-lines, mobilized rhetoric) increases adversary threat perception and domestic political pressure, raising the probability of tit-for-tat reprisals and accelerating escalation dynamics.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">western_alliance_realign</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
